%% 事实源: .spec/diagrams/walle-architecture-topology.json view_interactive_runtime
sequenceDiagram
  participant User as 用户
  participant CLI as cmd/walle
  participant TUI as internal/tui
  participant Socket as supervisor.sock
  participant HTTP as localhost HTTP Gateway
  participant Daemon as internal/daemon
  participant Runtime as internal/runtime

  User->>CLI: walle
  CLI->>Socket: open workspace Runtime(cwd, continue=false)
  alt socket 不存在
    CLI->>Daemon: 启动 "walle daemon"
    Daemon-->>Socket: supervisor 就绪
    CLI->>Socket: 重试 open
  end
  Socket->>Daemon: 创建 Runtime(ProjectDir=cwd, ContinueLast=false)
  Daemon-->>Socket: attached + history + ready
  CLI->>TUI: LaunchAttachedTUI
  TUI->>Socket: input / stop / detach
  Socket->>Daemon: 路由到 DaemonSession
  Daemon->>Runtime: Submit / Stop
  Runtime-->>Daemon: assistant / tool / state 事件
  Daemon-->>Socket: live event
  Socket-->>TUI: 渲染

  opt walle daemon --http
    User->>HTTP: GET /v1/processes 或 POST /v1/runtimes/open
    HTTP->>Daemon: list / open / snapshot / input / stop
    User->>HTTP: WS /v1/runtimes/{id}/attach
    HTTP-->>User: attached + history + ready + live event
    User->>HTTP: GET /v1/runtimes/{id}/events
    HTTP-->>User: SSE readonly event stream
  end

  User->>CLI: walle -c
  CLI->>Socket: open workspace Runtime(cwd, continue=true)
  Socket->>Daemon: attach 最近匹配 Runtime，或创建 Runtime(ContinueLast=true)
